# Project index

CO4031 (HK261) builds a seller-performance data warehouse and DSS on the Olist Brazilian E-Commerce dataset. Architecture is a Databricks Free Edition medallion lakehouse: Bronze (full-load overwrite staging) → Silver (full-load overwrite, clean/conform) → Gold (Kimball bottom-up data mart, fact constellation, star schema, Delta MERGE), plus schema `dss` for model outputs. Batch only. OLAP is ROLAP in Power BI through a SQL Warehouse. Streamlit is the query and DSS UI. Incremental load, append, CDF, and Auto Loader are future work. Topic T1 was locked on 15/10/2026 after gates G1–G6; fallback T2 would have used the same Gold mart.

## Source-of-truth order

1. `docs/assignment/CO4031_Assignment_HK261.pdf` (assignment)
2. `docs/SPEC.md` (requirements R-xx, architecture, DSS)
3. `docs/PLAN.md` (phases, tasks, definition of done)
4. `docs/DESIGN.md` (schema and mappings; still a Phase 0 skeleton)
5. Code under `src/`

If code and SPEC disagree, follow SPEC and fix the code. Do not invent a convention that contradicts SPEC.

## Start of every session

Read, in order: `README.md` → `docs/SPEC.md` → `docs/PLAN.md` → the newest entry in `docs/PROGRESS_LOG.md`. Open `docs/DESIGN.md` or `data/README.md` only when the task touches schema, ETL mapping, or data files.

## Which rule applies

| Rule | Trigger | Use when |
|---|---|---|
| `01-language-git` | always | Language, commits, secrets |
| `02-ambiguity-scope` | always | Unclear requests, scope, locked decisions |
| `03-docs-workflow` | always | Multi-file work, RTM, PLAN, log |
| `04-data-integrity` | always | Any use of Olist or sample data |
| `05-medallion-layers` | `src/etl/**`, `src/sql/**`, `src/notebooks/**` | Layer contract |
| `06-dw-modeling` | `src/sql/ddl/**`, `src/etl/**`, `docs/DESIGN.md` | Facts, dims, grain |
| `07-spark-databricks` | `src/etl/**`, `src/notebooks/**` | Spark notebooks and local rerun |
| `08-sql-olap` | `src/sql/**` | Spark SQL and OLAP queries |
| `09-dss` | `src/dss/**`, `src/frontend/**` | Models and DSS UI |
| `10-testing-dq` | `src/tests/**`, `src/etl/**` | pytest and data-quality checks |
| `11-commands-env` | agent-requested | Shell, venv, dependencies |

Layer rules do not repeat each other. Modeling details live in `06`. Spark runtime details live in `07`. DSS parameters live in `09`.
